The Video Disk Recorder (VDR) turns a computer with one or more DVB
devices into a digital video recorder and set-top box.

Main features:
* Records one or more programs at the same time, also while watching
  live TV.
* Time-shifting: pause live TV, or start watching a recording before it
  has finished.
* On-screen display (OSD) menus, completely controllable with a remote
  control (LIRC) or keyboard.
* Electronic program guide (EPG) and timer-based recordings.
* SVDRP network protocol for remote control and integration with other
  software.
* Plugin interface. This package includes the skincurses, pictures and
  epgtableid0 plugins as well as the upstream example plugins.
